  m_text: "<u>Right Player:</u> \nSurvive!\nArrow keys are movement. \nAttacks are
    automatic (melee)\n\n<u>Left Player:</u> \nGamble!</u> Help the right player!\n\n<u>Both
    Players</u> \nKilled enemies drop tokens for gambling\nSuccesful gambles improve
